# CLI deploys upload the working tree. Agent worktrees, Next output, and the
# document spike are why a local `vercel --prod` once offered 16k files / 1.2GB
# and then died on a broken symlink. GitHub deploys never see these.
#
# Paths are root-anchored: a bare `artifacts` previously excluded
# `src/integrations/artifacts/` and the production build could not resolve
# `blob-store`.
.claude
.cursor
.serena
.agents
.designops
/.next
/node_modules
/coverage
/dist
/vendor
/experiments
/artifacts
/.doc-blind-test
/.blind-test
/Remediation-Design
